HB0196 Ballot initiatives-duplicate laws passed.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Lien, Brady, Johnson and Lucas
AN ACT relating to elections; removing a provision allowing for ballot
proposition initiatives to be deemed void and not placed on the election ballot
as specified; and providing for an effective date.
